# One steel plate of the foundry floor. Tiles on both axes, drawn at 2x to
# land on the arena's existing 80px grid.
#
# The player looks at nothing but this for the whole game, so it gets grime and
# bolts — but at the lowest contrast in the palette. A floor with any real
# contrast competes with the thing chasing you, and the arena is 2400x1600 of
# it against at most a dozen enemies.
name shooter-floor
size 40 40
key t tar-1
key d tar-0-pit
key m tar-2
key s tar-0-pit
key o outline
key D tar-3-rim
